{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54109","headline":"礼舍利塔 · 宗亮","name":"礼舍利塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁轮王使鬼神功，灵塔飞来鄮岭东。\n有客不随流水去，罄敲疎雪细云中。\n（明郭子章《明州阿育王山志》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宗亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}